# to a great degree; [[notably]], [[highly]]
#: ''Everyone supported the nominee because she was '''eminently''' qualified.''
#* {{quote-journal
|date=August 5, 2012
|author=Nathan Rabin
|title=TV: Review: THE SIMPSONS (CLASSIC): “I Love Lisa” (season 4, episode 15; originally aired 02/11/1993)
|url=http://www.avclub.com/articles/i-love-lisa,83183/
